    "SL-DES-02 \uBCC0\uC555\uD761\uCC29(PSA)\uC6A9 \uC2E4\uB9AC\uCE74\uAC94 (A\uD615)",
    "SL-DES-02 \xB7 Pressure Swing Adsorption (PSA) Silica Gel (Type A)",
